%% TECH-031 Next.js security upgrade
%% How the upgrade is checked: the audit, a first-try build and test run, then the whole suite.
flowchart TD
    A[npm install next 16.4.6 and eslint-config-next 16.4.6] --> B{npm audit: advisory for next?}
    B -- yes --> A
    B -- no --> C[R1: no advisory]
    C --> D{First build and test run without the security stop?}
    D -- no --> A
    D -- yes --> E[R2: no stop]
    E --> F{Lint, type check, build, unit and browser tests pass?}
    F -- no --> G[Read the release notes and fix the cause]
    G --> F
    F -- yes --> H[R3: unchanged behaviour, then smoke tests on preview and live]
